    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The reader's V1 'supports' and 'limits_scope' labels are removed. The vector is CAA from safe/unsafe response pairs, not the harmful-minus-harmless instruction direction, and the paper does no ablation. The paper cites Arditi et al. only as background. Base-vs-STA and base-vs-RePS rows were not extracted, but they would likewise not bear on V1. The response classifier is Qwen3Guard-8B (84% F1). Jailbreak prompts were optimised on the base model and transferred to the steered configurations."
  },
